 119:lib/freertos/portable/MemMang/heap_4.c **** /*
 120:lib/freertos/portable/MemMang/heap_4.c ****  * Inserts a block of memory that is being freed into the correct position in
 121:lib/freertos/portable/MemMang/heap_4.c ****  * the list of free memory blocks.  The block being freed will be merged with
 122:lib/freertos/portable/MemMang/heap_4.c ****  * the block in front it and/or the block behind it if the memory blocks are
 123:lib/freertos/portable/MemMang/heap_4.c ****  * adjacent to each other.
